The words you are about to experience are true. 
They will change your life if you let them. 
My child, you may not know me, but I know everything about you. Psalms
I knew you even before you were conceived. Jeremiah
I chose you when I planned creation. Ephesians
You were not a mistake, for all your days are written in My book. Psalms
I knit you together in your mother's womb. Psalms
And brought you forth on the day you were born. Psalm
I have always been Father, and will always be Father. Ephesians 3, 14-15
My question is, will you be my child? John 1, 12-13
I am waiting for you. Luke 15, 11-32
Love, Your Dad. 
